# Documents and fonts are binary. The lease PDF in particular has uncompressed
# content streams, so it contains no NUL bytes and git guesses "text" for it.
# Normalising its line endings shifts every byte offset in the cross reference
# table and the file stops parsing.
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ttf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary

# The sample CSV ships deliberate mixed line endings, which a parser test
# asserts on. Never normalise them.
assets/documents/*.csv -text
